  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_1427.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Dentro del marco de celebraciones del XXV Aniversario del Grup Folcl&ograve;ric d&#39;Onda, la indumentarista Conxa Oliver pronunci&oacute; anoche&nbsp;una charla sobre La mujer y su indumentaria en el siglo XVIII, en la sala Col&oacute;n del Local de Asociaciones.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaindumengrupfolcloric/img_1423.jpg\" alt=\"img_1423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaindumengrupfolcloric/img_1424.jpg\" alt=\"img_1424\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaindumengrupfolcloric/img_1425.jpg\" alt=\"img_1425\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaindumengrupfolcloric/img_1426.jpg\" alt=\"img_1426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaindumengrupfolcloric/img_1427.jpg\" alt=\"img_1427\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaindumengrupfolcloric/img_1430.jpg\" alt=\"img_1430\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
